      <tei:div type="notes">
        <tei:p>The Yiddish resistance song, “Partisaner Lid” (The Partisan Song) was composed by Hirsh Glik (1922-1944) in the Vilna Ghetto in 1943. This song is included in “A Ḥanukkah Madrikh!” (2011) by Noam Lerman &amp; Aharon Varady. Ukrainian translation added in February 2022 by comYakowenko.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Recordings</tei:p>
